"A module's datatype whose tag the program's has too: FX-26's tags are
 the sum's, found by its type; KFX's emitter finds a datatype by its tag,
 so each tag names one (C19)."
(define-effect kfx (maxeff (read @globals) spin))
(define-datatype point (pt i64 i64))
(define m (module (define-datatype place (pt i64))))
(with m (pt 1))
